--- B. ADAPT TIMING CLARIFICATION (microseconds, mean +/- SD) ---
   Adapt checked total        66.303 +/-  0.032   (PROTOCOL: las_adapt above, incl. internal PreVerify)
   witness-add only            2.255 +/-  0.004   (DIAGNOSTIC ONLY: z=z_hat+r'; not a protocol op)
